    "show_share": true,
    "description": "January 2026 was a powerhouse month for the Centre, blending grassroots community engagement with high-level international collaboration. From welcoming Simanjiro Maasai leaders to launching global mobility networks, AKU-ACER is setting a fast pace for the year ahead.",
